1. Stripped `" (Rh negative)"` suffix from `formatBloodGroup(patient.bloodGroupText)` in the hub facts row of [PatientHubHeader.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/PatientHubHeader.kt#L356) so the value is not duplicated or ellipsized.
2. Replaced the single-line `Row` in the GA cell with `FlowRow(modifier = Modifier.testTag("gestationalAgeBadge"), horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(4.dp), verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(2.dp), itemVerticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically)` in [PatientHubHeader.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/PatientHubHeader.kt#L330-L341) so the discordance marker wraps instead of clipping.
3. Updated the delivered cell in [PatientHubHeader.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/PatientHubHeader.kt#L318-L326) to wrap via `Text(text = ltrIsolate(deliveredHeadline(patient.deliveryDate)), style = RecordType.MetricValue, color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurface)`.
4. Guarded the tags `FlowRow` in [PatientHubHeader.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/PatientHubHeader.kt#L263-L309) so it is only composed when at least one child tag is shown, eliminating the empty 0px row and double 10 dp gap.
5. Deleted the unused `status_normal_risk` string in [strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml#L705) and removed unused `prefix` and `bodyText` variables in `CompactClinicalAttentionStrip` in [PatientHubHeader.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/PatientHubHeader.kt#L593-L595).
